				},
				{
					"id": 230240202,
					"content": "和兩位藥農一起仔細地觀察了尚未盛開的薔薇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230240203,
					"content": "沒有動靜啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240204,
						230240205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240204,
					"content": "看不出什麼跡象…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230240206,
					"content": "#哎呀…也許是這株薔薇有些不好意思在{F#妳}{M#你}們面前盛開吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240207,
					"content": "不過，根據薔薇的生長規律，最慢明天，肯定會開花的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240208,
					"content": "#旅行者，請{F#妳}{M#你}明天再過來吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240205,
					"content": "腿都站麻了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240206
					]
				}
