					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240404,
					"content": "可喜可賀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230240405,
					"content": "薔薇開花了，我們也很開心哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240406,
					"content": "呼…這下子總算可以按時向「健康之家」那邊交貨了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240407,
					"content": "希望這株薔薇能幫上他們的忙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
