				},
				{
					"id": 230240703,
					"content": "「健康之家」的醫生們應該也會驚嘆吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240704,
					"content": "事不宜遲，我這就去把這株花給移出來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240705,
					"content": "等等，這是…什麼動靜？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240706,
					"content": "花田中爆發出了異樣的躁動…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230240707,
					"content": "嗚哇！是騙騙花！怎麼會出現在這裡？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240708,
					"content": "糟了！花田！它要把花田毀掉了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240709,
						230240710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240709,
					"content": "我來解決它！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240711
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230240711,
					"content": "欸…欸？那隻騙騙花…怎麼逃跑了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240712,
					"content": "怎麼會…怎麼會這樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240713,
					"content": "我們的薔薇，最重要的草藥…居然變成魔物逃走了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240714,
						230240715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240714,
					"content": "並不是「變成」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230240716,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}的意思是…這株薔薇之所以生長緩慢，就是因為這隻騙騙花在搗亂？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240717,
					"content": "這麼一說！完全沒有作用的肥料…兩倍的澆水量…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230240718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230240718,
